#: components/microsite/Faq.vue:3
msgid "@independent-journalists/faq"
msgstr ""
"<h2>What is Kairly?</h2> \n"
"<p> \n"
"Kairly is an emerging platform for journalists and their readers, which "
"offers<strong> a unique concept of paid content</strong>. \n"
"</p> \n"
"<h2>Why is it unique?</h2> \n"
"<p> \n"
"We are returning the role of editors to journalism. Editors at Kairly "
"publish newspapers. They include in them the best articles and tweets from "
"authors across the platform. \n"
"<strong>The readers pay a subscription for the newspapers</strong>. \n"
"<strong>Money is then divided between the editor and the authors</strong>  "
"who appeared in editions of newspapers.\n"
"</p> \n"
"<h2>What it brings to the readers?</h2> \n"
"<p> \n"
" We have no advertising. We're not spying anyone. Our readers don't scroll "
"endlessly. <strong>They only read what they really want to read \n"
" and always when they want to read it</strong>. \n"
"</p> \n"

