#: pages/platform/think-tanks.vue:52
msgid "Publish your ideas on a modern platform and reach out to new audiences."
msgstr ""

#: pages/platform/think-tanks.vue:54
msgid "@think-tanks/modern-platform"
msgstr ""
"<p> \n"
"Focus on communicating your ideas. We make sure that your content reaches "
"the people at its best, whether they're using a computer, cellphone, tablet "
"or electronic book reader.</p> \n"
"<p> \n"
"Our platform is focused on creating a pleasant environment for readers where "
"they only read what they really care about and are not bothered by constant "
"notifications. <p> \n"
"We come up with a unique concept of digital newspapers. If a newspaper "
"editor finds your content interesting and well-crafted, it will include your "
"article to the issue of their newspaper. This allows you to reach new "
"audiences for your idea.</p> \n"

#: pages/platform/think-tanks.vue:82
msgid "Get regular monetary contributions from your followers."
msgstr ""

#: pages/platform/think-tanks.vue:84
msgid "@think-tanks/monetizing-content"
msgstr ""
"<p> \n"
"We come up with a brand new concept of paid content on the Internet. It also "
"includes the possibility of regular payments from readers to organizations "
"like yours.</p> \n"
"<p> \n"
"Readers can subscribe to your content for free. You may also require a "
"regular monthly subscription. Whether your content is free or not, readers "
"can voluntarily and regularly contribute extra money.</p> \n"
"<p> \n"
"Your content may also appear in a variety of digital newspapers. Not only "
"will you reach new groups of people, you will also get a fair share from "
"newspaper subscription. That way you will earn extra money.</p> \n"

#: pages/platform/think-tanks.vue:161
msgid "Digital Publishing Platform for Think-tanks & NGOs"
msgstr ""

#: pages/platform/think-tanks.vue:166
msgid ""
"Kairly is a digital publishing platform for think-tanks and NGOs that allow "
"them to receive voluntary donations."
msgstr ""

#: pages/platform/publishers.vue:7
msgid "Are you an independent publisher?"
msgstr ""

#: pages/platform/publishers.vue:16
msgid "Publish your newspapers and magazines on a modern platform."
msgstr ""

#: pages/platform/publishers.vue:17
msgid ""
"Start earning on your publications with a unique concept of paid content."
msgstr ""

#: pages/platform/publishers.vue:18
msgid "Reach new audiences."
msgstr ""

#: pages/platform/publishers.vue:58
msgid ""
"Publish your newspapers and magazines on a modern platform and reach out to "
"new readers."
msgstr ""

#: pages/platform/publishers.vue:60
msgid "@publishers/modern-platform"
msgstr ""
"<p> \n"
"Focus on what you're good at. On publishing content. We will make sure that "
"your content reaches the readers in the best possible form, whether they are "
"on a computer, mobile, tablet or ebooks.</p> \n"
"<p> \n"
"We are lovers of good old paper newspapers and magazines. The platform "
"design combines the best of the era of printed periodicals and modern UX "
"trends from today's mobile and web applications.</p> \n"
"<p> \n"
"Our unique concept of digital newspapers lets you reach new readers. Greater "
"possibilities for personalization of content, as well as regularity of "
"publishing, lead to the formation of readers' habits and thus more loyalty "
"to your publications.</p> \n"

#: pages/platform/publishers.vue:87
msgid "Make money on your publications with a unique concept of paid content."
msgstr ""

#: pages/platform/publishers.vue:89
msgid "@publishers/monetizing-content"
msgstr ""
"<p> \n"
"Advertising can't pay good content. Readers need to learn to pay for quality "
"content again. We have to be smart about it. Engage your publishing company "
"in our unique paid content system.</p> \n"
"<p> \n"
"Publish your titles through our unique concept of digital newspapers and "
"start publishing new, more focused titles to help you reach new readers "
"through the personalization and that will increase the likelihood of buying "
"a monthly subscription.</p> \n"
"<p> \n"
"Thanks to the openness of the entire platform, your original content may "
"also appear in the edition of the other editors' newspaper. You will then "
"receive a fair monetaryreward from the newspaper's subscription where your "
"post appeared.</p> \n"

